# Django-era static assets (defensive). The Go backend never serves
# from /admin/ or /rest_framework/. Earlier commits deleted their
# contents; these lines stop a future `git add -A` from re-pulling
# them in if a Django-era toolchain is run on the host.
static/admin/
static/rest_framework/